      "message": "[error] Line 4557: 🔴 `erase()` is not synchronized with ongoing/new operations: it only closes currently idle repos, then immediately deletes the directory. A concurrent operation can still hold (or newly open) a repository and race with `removeAll`, leading to failed deletion on some platforms or use-after-delete behavior in git operations. Guard `erase()` with the same conversation operation lock/lifecycle gate used by mutating operations (or mark the repo as closing and block `repository()`/new ops before deletion), then wait until all borrowed repos are returned before removing files.",
